$$
\operatorname{tr}\!\left(
 [E((1-u_s)D^\dagger D+(1-v_s)T^\dagger T)E^\dagger
     +(I_5-P)]\rho\right).
\tag{TA.53}
$$

This includes the entire complementary probability even though it
later fails. On every original history it is
